    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Michael Gilmartin are delighted to bring No. 9 Derg Manor to the market.\n\nSituated just metres from the shores of Lough Derg in the popular lakeside village of Dromineer, Co. Tipperary, this beautifully presented 3 bedroom detached bungalow is set within a small and attractive development of just 12 houses.\n\nOn entering the property, there is a spacious open-plan living/dining area featuring an open fire and sliding doors, providing access to the rear garden. The kitchen is located just off the dining area and provides a practical and well-positioned space.\n\nThe bedroom accommodation comprises three double bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from an en-suite. The accommodation is completed by a family bathroom.\n\nTo the rear of the property is a lovely garden with attractive countryside views, while the front of the property provides a lawned area and ample off-street parking for up to three cars.\n\nThe property offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a detached bungalow in a superb location, just a short distance from Lough Derg and all that Dromineer has to offer.\n\nNo. 9 Derg Manor would make an ideal first-time buyer home, retirement property or holiday home.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate this well-presented property and its wonderful lakeside location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Area - 5.866w x 5.838d\n\n\nDining Area - 3.303w x 3.882d\n\n\nKitchen - 3.303w x 2.5d\n\n\nBedroom 1 to Front - 3.759w x 3.159d\nCarpet Flooring\n\nBedroom 2 to Front - 3.159w x 3.331d\nCarpet Flooring\n\nBedroom 3 To Rear - 3.982w x 3.166d\nCarpet Flooring, 4 door built in wardrobe\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 0.662w x 2.460d\nElectric Shower\n\nMain Bathroom - 1.369w x 3.143d\nwc, whb, bath\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Lakeside village location.</li><li> 3 double bedrooms with one ensuite.</li><li> Spacious living/dining room.</li><li> Galvanised shed to rear.</li><li> Oil Heating</ul>"
